LOCUS       pOpen-bjaR-GFP-native   3877 bp    DNA     linear   SYN 13-JUN-2024
DEFINITION  pBjaR-GFP / bjaR composite insert, native sequence. Optimized bjaR
            protein from Smith, et al (2023). Expresses the bjaR activator, and
            expresses GFP when induced with IV-HSL. pOpen shuttle plasmid.
